OL,5,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FJill and Inez host the second
OL,7,     Fvisit at Middlewick in
OL,8,     FGlastonbury, where their guests
OL,9,     Fare confounded by a cottage next
OL,10,     Fto a camping pod, and by the
OL,11,     Favocado breakfast offering.
OL,12,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FHosts Jamie and Leila teach their
OL,14,     Fguests all about their family
OL,15,     Fheritage at The Griffin Inn in
OL,16,     FLincolnshire. But the dirt is
OL,17,     Fdished about the decorating, and
OL,18,     Fdamp patches are a problem.
